diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 90e3032..25a2191 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -4,6 +4,20 @@
 
 A native PC recompilation of the Xbox 360 version of GoldenEye 007.
 
+> [!IMPORTANT]
+> This community fork includes the native XACT audio repairs from
+> [upstream PR #114](https://github.com/SunJaycy/GoldenEye-Recomp/pull/114)
+> and the tank mouse-aim repair from
+> [upstream PR #116](https://github.com/SunJaycy/GoldenEye-Recomp/pull/116).
+> It restores the 007 watch theme, Mission Select music after missions, and
+> the Control/Caverns elevator tracks without extracted WAV files. It also
+> restores horizontal mouse aiming while driving the Runway tank, the animated
+> Frigate water surface at every camera height, and the original delayed body
+> fade instead of dead enemies disappearing immediately.
+>
+> Windows 1.2.4 users can download the tested replacement executable from the
+> [latest GoldenEye Recomp Community Fix release](https://github.com/mrfox-1/GoldenEye-Recomp-Watch-Music-Fix/releases/latest).
+
 ## A quick note
 
 I've been getting a lot of hate over this project, so I want to address it once and move on.
